mott6:es-0076 a ev:EvidenceSpan ;
    rdfs:label "mott6-es-0076" ;
    ev:blockIdentifier "mott6/p591/b8" ;
    ev:boundingBox "62.97,266.29,305.76,338.33" ;
    ev:extractedText "We will use the method developed in Example Problem 14–1 to refine the procedure for computing the required basic dynamic load rating C for a given design load Pd and a given design life Ld. If the reported load data in the manufacturer’s literature is for 106 revolutions, Equation (14–1) can be written as"@en ;
